  "scope": "Add pure Markdown subpath slicing and finite-depth/cycle guards in crates/doc, preserving the original source bytes and making unresolved or duplicate subpaths explicit.",
  "behavior": [
    "Heading and block slices use the existing fence-aware subpath identity parser. Heading slices stop before the next heading of equal or higher outline level; block slices remove only the block marker. Selected slices normalize line endings to LF, while an empty subpath returns the full original text.",
    "Subpath outcomes distinguish resolved, unresolved and ambiguous. The source MarkdownSource remains byte-identical after selection.",
    "Nested transclusion guards reject depth beyond three and repeated target paths. A 512 KiB decoded-source bound is exposed for callers.",
    "Vault path resolution, Markdown-only embed filtering, bounded file reads, VaultSession integration and native rendering remain follow-up work; the byte-bound helper is not itself a bounded read."
  ],
